# Turborepo Configuration Standards

<rule>
name: turborepo_configuration
description: Standards for Turborepo configuration across the project
filters:
  - type: file_name
    pattern: "^turbo\\.json$"

actions:
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      When configuring Turborepo:

      1. Basic Configuration Structure:
         ```json
         {
           "$schema": "https://turbo.build/schema.json",
           "globalDependencies": ["**/.env.*local"],
           "tasks": {
             "task-name": {
               // task configuration
             }
           }
         }
         ```

      2. Task Configuration:
         ```json
         {
           "tasks": {
             // Build tasks
             "build": {
               "dependsOn": ["^build"],
               "outputs": ["dist/**", ".next/**"]
             },
             // Development tasks
             "dev": {
               "cache": false,
               "persistent": true
             },
             // Test tasks
             "test": {
               "dependsOn": ["^build"],
               "inputs": ["src/**/*.{ts,tsx}", "test/**/*.{ts,tsx}"]
             }
           }
         }
         ```

      3. Environment Variables:
         ```json
         {
           "globalEnv": ["SHARED_ENV_VAR"],
           "tasks": {
             "task-name": {
               "env": ["TASK_SPECIFIC_ENV"]
             }
           }
         }
         ```

      4. Best Practices:
         - Always include "$schema" for better IDE support
         - Use "globalDependencies" for files affecting all tasks
         - Set "cache": false for development tasks
         - Set "persistent": true for long-running tasks
         - Use "outputs" to specify cached artifacts
         - Use "^" prefix in dependsOn for topological dependencies
         - Use "env" arrays for task-specific environment variables
         - Use "globalEnv" for workspace-wide environment variables

      5. Common Task Types:
         ```json
         {
           "tasks": {
             // Build tasks
             "build": {
               "dependsOn": ["^build"],
               "outputs": ["dist/**"]
             },
             // Development tasks
             "dev": {
               "cache": false,
               "persistent": true
             },
             // Test tasks
             "test": {
               "dependsOn": ["^build"]
             },
             // Lint tasks
             "lint": {
               "outputs": []
             },
             // Type checking
             "check-types": {
               "cache": false
             }
           }
         }
         ```

      6. File Structure:
         ```
         PROJECT_ROOT/
         ├── turbo.json
         ├── package.json
         └── apps/
             └── your-app/
                 └── package.json
         ```

examples:
  - input: |
      {
        "pipeline": {
          "build": {
            "dependsOn": ["^build"]
          }
        }
      }
    output: |
      {
        "$schema": "https://turbo.build/schema.json",
        "tasks": {
          "build": {
            "dependsOn": ["^build"],
            "outputs": ["dist/**"]
          }
        }
      }

  - input: |
      {
        "tasks": {
          "dev": {
            "cache": true
          }
        }
      }
    output: |
      {
        "$schema": "https://turbo.build/schema.json",
        "tasks": {
          "dev": {
            "cache": false,
            "persistent": true
          }
        }
      }

metadata:
  priority: high
  version: 2.0
  source: "https://turbo.build/repo/docs"
</rule> 